WEBVTT

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.690
Mommy, I want yakisoba!

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.690
I'm starting to get nervous.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.410
<b>Free</b>

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.410
<b>Dive in over here</b>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.670
Huh? Where's Kohane?

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.390
Um, Kohane-chan... went to go do that.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.820
Huh?!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.710
Whee!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.980
Please move forward and wait your turn.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.150
Kohane!

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.560
What are you thinking?! Do you want to die?

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.470
I thought I might need to 
feel like I was going to die...

00:00:57.470 --> 00:00:59.240
And what if you actually die?

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.060
Um...

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.830
Could you not say that?

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.090
S-Someone died?

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:10.840
A diving accident?

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.090
Yikes...

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.440
Huh? Oh... I'm sorry!

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.980
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:50.320
Why would you try to go diving like that?

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:54.520
I wanted to get a little more used to heights 
while we're at this training camp.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.820
Such commendable spirit!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.150
That's clearly going too far!

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.740
Now, now...

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.410
<i>They're like parents arguing about 
how to raise their child.</i>

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:11.920
<b>Episode 11: Exciting Shoulder Straddle</b>

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:09.910
Regardless of how you go about it,

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.260
you're trying to go too far on your own.

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:17.130
We're a team, so let's figure 
something out together.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.170
Kotecchan...

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.880
That's what you were trying 
to say, right, Hanawa-san?

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.830
Th-Th-That's not it!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:29.900
I-I was just saying that she's making trouble 
for everyone by acting on her own!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:30.880
That's it!

00:03:30.880 --> 00:03:33.150
Don't kill her to hide your embarrassment!

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.860
How about we do some stunts in the ocean?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:41.860
It won't be as scary since 
the water's right there.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:45.370
<i>So, we tried it out.</i>

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.210
One, two, down, up!

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.210
<b>Slipping</b>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:52.710
<b>Slipping + Buoyancy</b>

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.710
<b>Slipping + Buoyancy = Flight</b>

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:03.510
Yeah... Maybe that wasn't the best idea.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.840
You landed on your face <i>and</i> your stomach?

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:09.720
We have to ice you! I'll go 
buy something cold to drink.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:16.640
But it might be a good idea to get 
used to heights through cheer.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.360
Once we finish lunch, 
let's get back to practice.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:23.100
Guys! I bought five yakisoba,

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:25.050
so they gave me a discount!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:27.220
Oh, perfect timing!

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:31.750
So, about that cold drink...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.620
<b>Chopsticks</b>

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.410
S-Sorry, Kohane-chan.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:39.370
Oh, it's fine. Maybe
I can cool it with this.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.880
Ow, that's hot...

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.590
I'm so sorry, Kohane-chan!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.680
Trying to get over heights 
with cheer practice, huh?

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:48.280
Well, either way, we have an event tomorrow,

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.410
so reviewing our moves for that comes first.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:54.760
Should we try a stunt that requires 
her to be a little higher up, then?

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.310
We'll go from the double base thigh stand...

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.800
to, you know!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.800
Sho... Shoo... Strike!

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.030
You forgot! And you got it wrong!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.600
You must mean the shoulder straddle.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.370
It's basically riding on someone's shoulders.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:11.450
You sure we should raise
the difficulty so suddenly?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.830
But we need to! No... I want to!

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.370
Let's give it everything we've got.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.880
Yeah! I'm never giving up!

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.460
Shoo... Sho... Shelder straddle!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:25.630
<b>Top

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:25.630
<b>Top

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:31.010
Kana-chan, thanks for not rubbing it in.

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:36.390
Now then, regarding shoulder straddles...

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.640
<b>Top

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:40.900
Transferring from a double base thigh stand 
to a shoulder straddle is pretty easy.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.900
<b>Top

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.400
<b>Spotter</b>

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:45.210
As for positions, Uki-san, you'll put 
your head between Kohane-san's legs

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:46.780
and be the base.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.330
Really? I can do that?

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.910
Yes...

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:53.160
The hard part will be the dismount.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.200
Death... mount?!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.660
It just means getting down.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.320
Kohane-san will take Uki-san's hands,

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:02.000
stretch out her legs behind her, 
and jump down.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.840
Take Uki's hands and go backwards?

00:06:05.440 --> 00:06:07.600
Death... mount?!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.260
It's "dismount."

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.050
While I figure out how to put 
Hanawa-san into our formation,

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:16.250
Kohane-san, please practice dismounting.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.520
Okay!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:19.520
So, wait. What should I do?

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:22.910
A vaulting box would help.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:25.530
I doubt that a kendo dojo would have that...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:28.600
Something to replace a vaulting box...

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:38.160
You wake me up out of the blue because 
you want me to be a vault horse?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.000
Are you demons?

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.670
You were able to sleep 
because we aren't demons.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:43.760
A vaulting box... In other words,

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.920
we want her to practice putting her 
hands onto your back and jumping off.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:07:00.190
Hop, down. Hop, down. Hop, down. Hop, down.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.480
Okay, let's go practice our own parts.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.480
Right!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.550
Um...

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:05.440
Did you not understand how to do it?

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:10.190
Looks like practice is over.

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.360
I think the human vaulting box broke.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.200
That was fast!

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:17.050
All right, let's all practice together, then.

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:19.710
We should work on the stunts first.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.460
One, two, down, up!

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:25.710
First, the double base thigh stand.

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.530
<i>We're gonna go from this to...</i>

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:32.220
<i>m-m-my head going between Kohane's legs...</i>

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.180
<i>Now's not the time to be embarrassed!</i>

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.440
Leave it to me!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:38.440
Peep?!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.900
Watch your posture!

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:41.520
Keep your body straight!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:45.440
Kohane-san, please secure your legs.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:48.520
L-L-... Like this?!

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:49.740
Fank you very much!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:51.450
Uki, don't thank her!

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.330
Are you okay, Uki?!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.240
Hey, keep your face up!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.420
O-Okay!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:16.140
Are you all right? Did you hurt anything?

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:18.460
I-I'm okay...

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.520
Sorry, I messed up.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.310
You raised your head too much.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.400
You almost had it, too. Jeez.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.320
She said you did a good job.

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.190
You got a compliment.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.480
Hey! Stop translating for me!

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.300
So they got the meaning right, then.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.820
It went better than I thought 
it would. That was great!

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:41.200
Maybe you <i>are</i> getting used 
to heights because of cheer.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.210
We might be able to work 
something out by tomorrow.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.260
Yes, if we practice as much as we can today.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.500
Okay.

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.030
Everyone's smiling!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:04.100
Y-Yeah... Even though you're 
smiling the most, Kohane-chan.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.060
<i>I should've known...</i>

00:09:07.510 --> 00:09:09.610
<i>I'm not doing this alone.</i>

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:13.110
<i>I have everyone supporting me.</i>

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:16.110
<i>This isn't like before!</i>

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:19.200
Let's try it one more time.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.400
Should we keep going continuously?

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.620
Yeah, let's do it!

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.880
Kohane-chan, your expression 
is indescribable right now!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:32.650
Oh, yeah. What should we do 
about our outfits tomorrow?

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.500
We didn't bring our uniforms this time.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.890
And we won't be able to make 
five of them overnight.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:43.000
If we're going to make some, we should 
make new ones for the tournament.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.310
What? New uniforms?

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:48.400
It's summer vacation, so we could get 
part-time jobs and buy some, too.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.780
So... what about tomorrow's outfits?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.040
We might slip.

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.170
<b>Sneakers!!</b>

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:14.090
<i>I can't believe I'm dressed like 
this in front of everyone.</i>

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.930
One, two, down, up!

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:29.060
One, two, down, up!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.700
<i>It's okay. I trust these girls.</i>

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.090
<i>I can keep looking forward.</i>

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:17.390
That was the Kaminoki High 
School Cheerleading Club!

00:11:17.390 --> 00:11:18.440
We did it!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.410
You didn't fall this time.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:23.420
You worked so hard, Kohane!

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.830
Jeez, you turned into her mom again.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:30.280
I was so happy when I did it that 
I almost glomped you, Uki!

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:31.390
I held back, though.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.380
<i>Glomped?!</i>

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:34.460
<i>Never mind. She's not a mom.</i>

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.590
If we keep this up, we'll be 
able to do even more stunts!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.280
Oh, I think I can even do 
that one thing right now!

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.430
That one thing?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:47.180
Peep?!

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:52.270
Sob... sob...

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.250
You always get ahead of yourself.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:11:59.570
Girls!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.630
I'm finally here!

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:03.950
Kohane-chan! Finally?

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.620
Great job, Kohane!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:08.970
I knew you could do it, Kohane-san.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.330
Hey, don't spoil her!

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:16.080
She only had to work longer because 
she broke too many plates!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:18.840
1st day of the part-time job

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:21.090
3rd day of the part-time job

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.340
7th day of the part-time job

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.340
Thank you very much!

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.240
Kohane, aren't you dropping too many plates?!

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.110
It's not every day, though!

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.180
Meaning it's almost every day...

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:34.040
We're the ones who should be praised.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:36.590
We actually did the job right!

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:38.110
Yes, you do have a point.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.330
Let's go buy our uniforms tomorrow!

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:44.000
You're pretty excited, huh?

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:47.040
Now that we can actually buy 
them, I can hardly wait!

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.700
I totally understand.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.600
And... holding on to this much money...

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.260
m-m-makes me so anxious!

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.140
Stop that. You look too suspicious.

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:02.340
Ta-da! I couldn't wait, so 
I thought of what I wanted!

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:04.420
A-Actually, so did I...

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.220
I did, as well.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.350
<b>Virtue</b>

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:15.230
A-Ah... I guess we all 
thought of the same thing.

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.370
<i>Well done! Good job not saying 
anything harsh, Kotetsu!</i>

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.030
Uki-chan, please stop...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:24.530
The Next Day

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:29.660
Oh, there she is.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.060
We told you to stop that!

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.910
B-B-But...

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:40.040
Y-Yukichi's asking me not to let him go...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.040
No, he's not!

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.350
I have to protect him.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.140
Put them in your wallet!

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:48.760
Besides, aren't we about to let 
those Yukichis fly free into the wild?

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.430
<i>Did we just see into her imagination?</i>

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.650
Welcome.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.320
Hi, we're here for some uniforms.

00:13:57.320 --> 00:13:59.690
Sure thing. Do you know what you'd like?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.740
We tried to get creative...

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.570
<b>Virtue</b>

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:08.570
U-Um... Let's see... It looks 
like she has long sleeves...

00:14:08.940 --> 00:14:10.410
maybe?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.990
<i>Well, she's definitely making an impact.</i>

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:16.710
Ah, so you're entering 
the upcoming tournament.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.760
But It might be hard to get a fully 
custom order in time right now.

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:23.240
We might make it if it's 
a semi-custom order...

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:23.880
Peep!

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:26.140
F-Fully custom order?!

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.090
For those, you sketch 
what you want it to look like,

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.680
and we'll make it using your designs.

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.230
I think we can pass on that this time!

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.100
Too bad!

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:38.640
First, let's have you 
pick out the main color.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.140
I wonder what color we should choose...

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.940
<i>We need to pick the color that'll 
make Senpai look the most beautiful!</i>

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:50.160
<i>Actually, Senpai might 
look amazing in any color!</i>

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.210
Th-This is harder than I thought...

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:55.800
Right? It's hard to choose one.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:59.040
<i>I'm pretty sure they're thinking 
about different things.</i>

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.960
Would you like to try on some 
sample uniforms so you can see

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.800
how the colors look and how they fit on you?

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:06.300
May we? Thank you very much.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:30.200
We're not some superhero squad!

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.960
U-Um, I just happened to pick yellow.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.200
It doesn't mean I like to eat a lot...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:40.080
But that uniform is super stretchy, 
so it'd still fit you even if you got fat.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.770
I'm not going to get fat!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.860
See? Look how much it stretches!

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:45.610
Hey...

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.550
Even if you get this big...

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.600
Kohane-chan...

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.880
It stretches this much!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:54.250
Peep!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:57.370
Look! It stretches so much!

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:04.510
Thank goodness... I thought that was 
the sound of the uniform tearing...

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.420
It's not okay at all.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.870
That one's great, Kana.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.950
Wh-Wh-Wh-What do you think, Senpai?!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.200
<i>I-I actually asked her!</i>

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.810
Well...

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:22.410
Frankly, I've looked at so many, 
they're all starting to look the same!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.580
Me, too!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:24.940
Hey!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.080
I don't know which one 
to pick anymore, either.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:26.880
Agreed.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.160
How dare you agree with her?!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.800
That's what's bugging you?

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:34.510
Oh?

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:36.570
It's Arima-chan and Ushiku-chan!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.720
It's been so long!

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.010
Th-The Nekoya Sisters?

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:41.120
Friends of yours?

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.100
Yes...

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.230
They're former teammates!

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:48.040
Your reaction implies that 
they weren't just teammates...

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:48.980
Not really!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:53.070
Hey, are you guys Arima-chan's new teammates?

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:57.130
We're on the same team, but 
now we're a high school team!

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:59.870
And so... I'm Nekoya Suzuko, and...

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.120
I'm Tamako!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.370
We're twins!

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.480
It could be because they're twins,

00:17:05.480 --> 00:17:08.320
but their cheers were always 
in perfect sync and beautiful...

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:09.260
I think.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.630
You're not sure?!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.650
Hey, Nekoyas!

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:20.260
They weren't in sync with 
anyone else, though.

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:22.140
I see...

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:26.900
Hey, did you want Hizume and 
Kana to come back or something?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.080
Not really.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.780
I'd say they can cheer wherever they want.

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:34.670
I mean, we all have our preferences.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:36.780
You should be free.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:39.660
So, how do you really feel?

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:43.720
Since you two left, we're the 
stars now! Talk about lucky!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:47.270
It was basically a godsend!
 We'd rather you didn't come back.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:49.040
You're way too honest!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.560
That's how these two are.

00:17:51.560 --> 00:17:53.420
They really don't hold back.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:54.400
Well...

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.880
We're just kidding.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.390
Whoever is on our team...

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:00.430
...doesn't really matter to us 
as long as we can have fun.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.680
You feel the same way, right, Arima-chan?

00:18:03.280 --> 00:18:05.370
Rather than matching everyone else,

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:07.810
you seemed to be enjoying 
cheer all on your own.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:13.440
You're right. Previously,
I wasn't aware of my surroundings.

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:17.340
Because of that, I can't tell you two apart.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.570
I don't think you can help that.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.800
But now I want to get better with my friends.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.080
I'd like to try various things.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.310
Ooh, did you change?

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:32.590
Was it love that changed you, Arima-chan?

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.930
Of course it wasn't!

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:38.470
Quit making stuff up!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:41.450
I see you're still hardcore 
into yuri, Ushiku-chan.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:43.370
She hasn't changed at all!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:45.280
Sh-Shut up!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:46.900
Yuri (lily)?

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:51.240
We'd love to see you cheer now 
that you've changed, Arima-chan.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:54.320
Of course, we'd love to see Ushiku-chan's,
too, even if it haven't changed.

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.480
Do you have any performances planned?

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.740
We've entered the tournament 
that's coming up.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.080
Oh, what a coincidence. 
We're gonna be in that, too!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.530
Wow, that's amazing!

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:07.050
I-Is that so?

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.770
The whole team will see me...

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.460
<i>Hizume's psyche's in trouble!</i>

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.420
How's... everyone on the team doing?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.930
Oh, you don't have to worry.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.360
Everyone's great.

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:21.500
Though our level went down 
since you left, Arima-chan.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:24.620
But we all came together to fill that hole,

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:27.320
so we turned a disaster into a blessing.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:28.310
Right?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.220
D-Disaster?

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.350
<i>They lifted her up just to 
bring her crashing down!</i>

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:34.980
So much happened with you, Arima-chan.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:39.850
It didn't really bother us, but the 
rest of the team felt pretty bad.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:44.240
I think the team might be relieved 
once they see you're doing okay.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.120
Relieved?

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.570
Well, we've got practice, so...

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.370
See you at the tournament!

00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.660
Don't just say something 
suggestive and leave!

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:00.440
Senpai?

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.930
Hanawa-san, I'm fine...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.920
You're not fine at all!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:06.920
Isn't that great?!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.060
Did she just take friendly fire?!

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:11.450
I mean, we're going to be able

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.560
to show everyone how much fun 
Hizume's having cheering now!

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:18.310
I'm sure her old team will 
feel at ease. I'm sure of it.

00:20:20.640 --> 00:20:22.450
You're right.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.450
Yes. I'll try even harder 
for that reason, as well.

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:28.580
I'm sorry that I made you all worry.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:32.330
I think we should just do our best 
at cheer and not worry about things.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:37.210
Yeah. The most important thing 
is that we're able to do our best.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.710
Which means our only enemy is ourselves.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:42.220
A battle with myself...

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.880
A battle with...

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.240
<i>...myself?</i>

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:48.120
<i>Another me.</i>

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.570
<i>Two of me.</i>

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:53.210
<i>Oh, I'd be like those kitty sisters!</i>

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:54.830
<i>What would I do if there were two of me?</i>

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.610
<i>One of us will cheer, 
and so will the other one!</i>

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.610
Kohane. Earth to Kohane. Hey!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.150
Okay!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:01.850
So that we can become one and 
give our all at the tournament,

00:21:01.850 --> 00:21:03.600
let's get matching uniforms!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.540
Oh, so you did remember!

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.870
Let's at least narrow down the colors.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:13.870
Okay, everyone. Please point 
to the color you like best.

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:16.870
One, two, ready, go!

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:18.750
Their hearts aren't one

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:22.510
That ended up taking a while.

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:26.890
Um, are you sure it's okay if we 
go with the navy blue I chose?

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.510
I think it's lovely!

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:30.640
<i>Because it's the color you chose, Senpai!</i>

00:21:30.640 --> 00:21:32.390
It's really elegant!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.020
<i>It's slimming, too!</i>

00:21:34.380 --> 00:21:36.770
We all agreed because 
we thought it was great!

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:38.650
<i>Kohane looked great in it, too!</i>

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:42.400
Their hearts aren't one

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:42.400
But they agreed.

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:47.280
I can't wait until we get our new uniforms.

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:49.130
Now we just need to 
practice as hard as we can

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:50.970
for the tournament so we 
don't have any regrets.

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:51.780
Indeed.

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:55.540
<i>Hizume's old team will be watching us.</i>

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.040
<i>I want to put them at ease.</i>

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:00.600
<i>We can't fail.</i>

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.720
Okay, let's do this!

00:23:38.180 --> 00:23:41.890
Next time: "One for All, All for One!"
